{"3961630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eidolon: Fate of Fools", "steam_appid": 3961630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1758912940\" /></span><br><br>Eidolon: Fate of Fools is a mystical arena shooter inspired by Major Arcana tarot cards. Indulge your fate by collecting cards within the arenas and by looting defeated foes. Dominate the lobby by cleverly utilizing both the Upright and Inverted abilities of each card. Upright abilities often resemble traditional arena shooter weapons, while Inverted abilities can offer unique movement tech or provide a tactical edge: at the cost of discarding that card. Master these arcane powers as you fight to prove your divinity and achieve apotheosis.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1758912940\" /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fill any match with skilled bots or join your friends</strong> over LAN and Steam lobbies.</li><li><strong>Master 13 Major Arcana tarot cards</strong> each with two abilities: Upright and Inverted.</li><li><strong>Battle within 4 hand-crafted arenas</strong> or visit the firing range to hone your skills.</li><li><strong>Experience free-for-all with a twist:</strong> 2 legendary Power Weapons may alter your fate.</li><li><strong>Enjoy 11 minutes of epic menu music</strong> featuring themes for each of the Major Arcana.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1758912940\" /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1758912940\" /></span><br><br>Eidolon: Fate of Fools is a mystical arena shooter inspired by Major Arcana tarot cards. Indulge your fate by collecting cards within the arenas and by looting defeated foes. Dominate the lobby by cleverly utilizing both the Upright and Inverted abilities of each card. Upright abilities often resemble traditional arena shooter weapons, while Inverted abilities can offer unique movement tech or provide a tactical edge: at the cost of discarding that card. Master these arcane powers as you fight to prove your divinity and achieve apotheosis.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1758912940\" /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fill any match with skilled bots or join your friends</strong> over LAN and Steam lobbies.</li><li><strong>Master 13 Major Arcana tarot cards</strong> each with two abilities: Upright and Inverted.</li><li><strong>Battle within 4 hand-crafted arenas</strong> or visit the firing range to hone your skills.</li><li><strong>Experience free-for-all with a twist:</strong> 2 legendary Power Weapons may alter your fate.</li><li><strong>Enjoy 11 minutes of epic menu music</strong> featuring themes for each of the Major Arcana.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1758912940\" /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.", "short_description": "An arena shooter with a card game twist in which combatants compete using Major Arcana tarot cards. Celestials manifest in a metaphysical realm for a combat ritual that results in divinity... or death. Vanquish your foes to achieve apotheosis and the coveted prize of securing your fate.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/6b318f363c4120f59f5ebec961901d73358c022c/header.jpg?t=1758912940", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/f3be66174d91c46bf6fbc3a2c7015b81dc51c2f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758912940", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961630/f3be66174d91c46bf6fbc3a2c7015b81dc51c2f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758912940", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recomm